OL,3,GNEWSAApprentice star tells PM why pie
OL,4,Ashop is closing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pie shop owner who starred in The
OL,7,FApprentice has told Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham he is closing one of his three
OL,9,Fshops because of rising business costs.
OL,11,FIn a social media post directed at the
OL,12,Fprime minister, Paul Bowen, who owns
OL,13,FBowen Pies in Chorley, Lancashire, said
OL,14,Fthe increase in employers' National
OL,15,FInsurance was "the tipping edge" to him
OL,16,Fshutting the shop on Market Street,
OL,17,Fdespite it taking #100,000 a year.
OL,19,F"We were already trying to cover
OL,20,Feverything else going up. Then the
OL,21,Fgovernment made it more expensive to
OL,22,Femploy people," he wrote.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
